---
// 一個提案一頁，網址是 issue 編號。內容在 build 時產生（分享連結才有預覽、搜尋引擎才看得到），
// 下方的討論在瀏覽器裡即時抓（理由見 src/lib/wish-discussion.ts）。
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { getWishes, wishDate, WISH_REPO, type Wish } from "../../lib/wishes";

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const wishes = await getWishes();
  return wishes.map((wish) => ({ params: { number: String(wish.number) }, props: { wish } }));
}

const { wish } = Astro.props as { wish: Wish };
const slackUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_WISH_SLACK_URL;
const description = wish.description ?? `${wish.title}——civictech.tw 許願池的提案。`;

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CreativeWork",
  name: wish.title,
  description,
  inLanguage: "zh-Hant-TW",
  dateCreated: wish.createdAt,
  url: new URL(`/w/${wish.number}`, "https://civictech.tw").href,
  isPartOf: { "@type": "WebSite", name: "台灣公民科技資料庫", url: "https://civictech.tw" },
};
---

<Base title={`${wish.title}｜許願池`} description={description} current="wish" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <article class="pt-28 sm:pt-32">
    <header class="wrap">
      <a href="/w" class="text-sm no-underline" style="color:var(--ink-muted)">← 許願池</a>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-[30ch] text-[1.9rem] font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-[2.4rem]" style="color:var(--ink)">
        {wish.title}
      </h1>
      {wish.description && (
        <p class="mb-0 mt-4 max-w-[52ch] text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--ink-2)">{wish.description}</p>
      )}
    </header>

    <div class="wrap mt-10 grid gap-10 pb-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.6fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-14">
      <div class="min-w-0 max-w-[68ch]">
        {wish.painPoint && (
          <section class="wish-field">
            <h2>現有工具的不足</h2>
            <p>{wish.painPoint}</p>
          </section>
        )}
        {wish.superpower && (
          <section class="wish-field">
            <h2>需要的超能力</h2>
            <p>{wish.superpower}</p>
          </section>
        )}

        <section class="mt-12 border-t pt-8" style="border-color:var(--line)" aria-labelledby="discussion-title">
          <h2 id="discussion-title" class="m-0 text-[1.25rem] font-semibold" style="color:var(--ink)">討論</h2>
          <p class="mb-6 mt-2 text-sm" style="color:var(--ink-muted)">
            合併 g0v Slack 討論串與 GitHub 上的留言。想加入討論，到
            {slackUrl ? <a href={slackUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--accent)">Slack 頻道</a> : "Slack 頻道"}
            或 <a href={wish.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--accent)">GitHub</a> 留言。
          </p>
          <div id="wish-discussion" data-repo={WISH_REPO} data-number={wish.number} data-url={wish.url} data-slack={slackUrl ?? ""}>
            <p class="discussion-status">讀取討論中…</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="text-sm lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start" style="color:var(--ink-muted)">
        <dl class="m-0 space-y-4 rounded-lg border p-5" style="border-color:var(--line);background:var(--surface)">
          {wish.progress && (
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs">目前進度</dt>
              <dd class="m-0 mt-1"><span class="badge">{wish.progress}</span></dd>
            </div>
          )}
          <div>
            <dt class="text-xs">提案日期</dt>
            <dd class="num m-0 mt-1" style="color:var(--ink)">{wishDate(wish.createdAt)}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
          {slackUrl && (
            <a
              href={slackUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 font-medium no-underline transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
              style="background:var(--accent-fill);color:var(--on-accent)"
            >
              到 Slack 一起聊
            </a>
          )}
          <a
            href={wish.url}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-4 py-2.5 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-[var(--surface-2)]"
            style="border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink-2)"
          >
            GitHub 提案頁
          </a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .wish-field + .wish-field {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .wish-field h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  /* 內文是訪客打的純文字，換行要照原樣留著 */
  .wish-field p {
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre-line;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .discussion-status {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment) {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment:first-child) {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-avatar) {
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-head) {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-author) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-source) {
    padding: 0.05rem 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-body) {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-body p) {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-body a) {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  #wish-discussion :global(.comment-body img) {
    max-width: 100%;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { githubComments, slackChannelId, slackComments, type Comment } from "../../lib/wish-discussion";

  const box = document.getElementById("wish-discussion");
  if (box) load(box);

  async function load(box: HTMLElement) {
    const { repo = "", number = "", url = "", slack } = box.dataset;
    const channel = slackChannelId(slack);
    // 兩邊各自失敗不影響另一邊：封存站還沒收錄頻道、GitHub 匿名額度用完，都只少一半
    const [gh, sl] = await Promise.allSettled([
      githubComments(repo, Number(number)),
      channel ? slackComments(channel, url) : Promise.resolve([]),
    ]);
    const comments = [gh, sl]
      .flatMap((r) => (r.status === "fulfilled" ? r.value : []))
      .sort((a, b) => a.at - b.at);
    const failed = [gh, sl].filter((r) => r.status === "rejected");
    failed.forEach((r) => console.error((r as PromiseRejectedResult).reason));

    if (comments.length === 0) {
      box.innerHTML = `<p class="discussion-status">${
        failed.length ? "討論暫時讀不到，可以直接到 Slack 或 GitHub 看。" : "還沒有人留言，來說第一句話吧。"
      }</p>`;
      return;
    }
    box.innerHTML = comments.map(render).join("");
  }

  function render(c: Comment): string {
    const when = new Date(c.at).toLocaleString("zh-TW", { timeZone: "Asia/Taipei", dateStyle: "medium", timeStyle: "short" });
    const avatar = c.avatar ? `<img class="comment-avatar" src="${escapeAttr(c.avatar)}" alt="" loading="lazy">` : `<span class="comment-avatar"></span>`;
    const time = c.url ? `<a href="${escapeAttr(c.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">${when}</a>` : when;
    return `<div class="comment">
      ${avatar}
      <div>
        <div class="comment-head">
          <span class="comment-author">${escapeAttr(c.author)}</span>
          <span class="comment-source">${c.source === "slack" ? "Slack" : "GitHub"}</span>
          <span>${time}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="comment-body">${c.html}</div>
      </div>
    </div>`;
  }

  function escapeAttr(s: string): string {
    return s.replace(/&/g, "&amp;").replace(/</g, "&lt;").replace(/>/g, "&gt;").replace(/"/g, "&quot;");
  }
</script>
